    <div>
      <p begin="00:10.150" end="00:12.730" ttm:agent="v1">Dwilly, I'm scared</p>
      <p begin="00:12.730" end="00:14.480" ttm:agent="v1">She a ghost killer</p>
      <p begin="00:14.480" end="00:17.840" ttm:agent="v1">Drown his body in the river, go, black figure</p>
      <p begin="00:17.840" end="00:21.290" ttm:agent="v1">Black mask with the ruger, don't pull the trigger</p>
      <p begin="00:21.290" end="00:22.790" ttm:agent="v1">Money bigger</p>
      <p begin="00:22.020" end="00:25.640" ttm:agent="v1">Only time I'm down is when I drop a bag, a bag to pick up</p>
      <p begin="00:25.640" end="00:28.880" ttm:agent="v1">And now he wanna walk out, lights, Glock, action</p>
      <p begin="00:28.880" end="00:31.850" ttm:agent="v1">Said she wanna stay and so she gave me satisfaction</p>
      <p begin="00:31.850" end="00:33.350" ttm:agent="v1">That bitch, she talk down</p>
      <p begin="00:33.230" end="00:35.040" ttm:agent="v1">Throwing bullets, where yo' cap bitch?</p>
      <p begin="00:35.040" end="00:38.180" ttm:agent="v1">Ruger got a flash, bang, bang, I caught you lackin'</p>
      <p begin="00:38.180" end="00:41.650" ttm:agent="v1">Say he wanna fuck with us, please don't fuck with us</p>
      <p begin="00:41.650" end="00:44.750" ttm:agent="v1">A black mask just in case we fuck it up</p>
      <p begin="00:44.750" end="00:47.070" ttm:agent="v1">She suck it up, we shut 'em up</p>
      <p begin="00:47.070" end="00:48.620" ttm:agent="v1">I'm at your crib, knock down your door</p>
      <p begin="00:48.620" end="00:51.010" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' bitch, I think your luck is up</p>
      <p begin="00:51.010" end="00:52.710" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause she a ghost killer</p>
      <p begin="00:52.710" end="00:55.940" ttm:agent="v1">Drown his body in the river, go, black figure</p>
      <p begin="00:55.940" end="00:58.660" ttm:agent="v1">Black mask with the ruger, don't pull the trigger</p>
      <p begin="00:58.660" end="01:00.160" ttm:agent="v1">Money bigger</p>
      <p begin="00:59.720" end="01:03.020" ttm:agent="v1">Only time I'm down is when I drop a bag, a bag to pick up</p>
      <p begin="01:03.020" end="01:06.230" ttm:agent="v1">And now he wanna walk out, lights, Glock, action</p>
      <p begin="01:06.230" end="01:09.110" ttm:agent="v1">Said she wanna stay and so she gave me satisfaction</p>
      <p begin="01:09.110" end="01:10.670" ttm:agent="v1">That bitch, she talk down</p>
      <p begin="01:10.670" end="01:12.620" ttm:agent="v1">Throwing bullets, where yo' cap bitch?</p>
      <p begin="01:12.620" end="01:15.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ruger got a flash, bang, bang, I caught you lackin' (ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:15.630" end="01:18.830" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I'm in a black mask, bring it back</p>
      <p begin="01:18.830" end="01:21.880" ttm:agent="v1">I just got a brand new Glock black, black</p>
      <p begin="01:21.880" end="01:24.950" ttm:agent="v1">Shoot 'em in his face, now he just a hashtag</p>
      <p begin="01:24.950" end="01:28.190" ttm:agent="v1">Bloody business, bury bitches while I'm in his Wraith</p>
      <p begin="01:28.190" end="01:31.540" ttm:agent="v1">All up in your flexed up, next up, Ghostface killa</p>
      <p begin="01:31.540" end="01:34.290" ttm:agent="v1">With my blade tucked, bitch get off my dick</p>
      <p begin="01:34.290" end="01:36.170" ttm:agent="v1">And ride that shit like a parade</p>
      <p begin="01:36.170" end="01:37.670" ttm:agent="v1">Set it off, break it off</p>
      <p begin="01:37.580" end="01:39.080" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' bitch, no you won't make it</p>
      <p begin="01:38.780" end="01:40.800" ttm:agent="v1">Why the fuck you think she let you crawl?</p>
      <p begin="01:40.800" end="01:42.530" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause she a ghost killer</p>
      <p begin="01:42.530" end="01:45.670" ttm:agent="v1">Drown his body in the river, go, black figure</p>
      <p begin="01:45.670" end="01:48.760" ttm:agent="v1">Black mask with the ruger, don't pull the trigger</p>
      <p begin="01:48.760" end="01:50.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Money bigger (uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:49.660" end="01:52.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Only time I'm down is when I drop a bag, a bag to pick up (a bag to pick up)</p>
      <p begin="01:52.710" end="01:56.040" ttm:agent="v1">And now he wanna walk out, lights, Glock, action</p>
      <p begin="01:56.040" end="01:59.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Said she wanna stay and so she gave me satisfaction (the satisfaction)</p>
      <p begin="01:59.120" end="02:00.620" ttm:agent="v1">That bitch, she talk down</p>
      <p begin="02:00.570" end="02:02.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Throwing bullets, where yo' cap bitch? (We don't cap bitch)</p>
